# Silvan Rally (the Adventure of Thranduil, Sindarin Liege): "Mill four cards, then put up to two land cards from among them into your
# hand." Bot1 mills a Forest, an Ornithopter, an Island and a Swamp and takes two lands, the Forest and the Island: the Ornithopter
# and the Swamp stay in the graveyard. The card is exiled as the spell resolves (CR 715.4) and on turn 3 Bot1 casts Thranduil from
# exile for his own mana cost.

